    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d31">

                <pb facs="0195" n="63" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg63"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    Leahy Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 31 <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Truman to Prime Minister Churchill
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d31-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-05-22">22 May 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Number 46, personal and top secret, from the President to the Prime Minister.</p>
                <p>I am asking Mr. Joseph E. Davies to come
                    to see you prior to the pending conference between you, Marshal Stalin and myself. There are a number
                    of matters that I want him to explore with you and which I would prefer not to
                    handle by cable. Mr. Davies will be in
                    London probably the twenty-fifth. I would appreciate it if you could see him at
                    your convenience.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Truman</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d31-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d31-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the United States Naval Attaché, London, via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
